Meal Plan for High-Activity Judo Athletes

Day 1:
Breakfast: Oatmeal with berries and nuts
Lunch: Chicken and rice bowl with steamed broccoli
Dinner: Baked salmon with quinoa and asparagus
Snack: Greek yogurt

Day 2:
Breakfast: Scrambled eggs with whole-wheat toast
Lunch: Lentil soup with whole-grain bread
Dinner: Turkey stir-fry with brown rice
Snack: Apple slices with peanut butter

Day 3:
Breakfast: Smoothie (spinach, banana, protein powder)
Lunch: Tuna salad sandwich on whole-grain bread
Dinner: Lean beef chili with beans
Snack: Handful of almonds

Day 4:
Breakfast: Whole-wheat pancakes with Greek yogurt
Lunch: Chicken breast wrap with whole-wheat tortilla
Dinner: Pasta with marinara and lean ground turkey
Snack: Cottage cheese

Day 5:
Breakfast: Greek yogurt parfait with granola and fruit
Lunch: Quinoa salad with chickpeas and chopped vegetables
Dinner: Baked cod with sweet potato and green beans
Snack: Hard-boiled eggs

Day 6:
Breakfast: Breakfast burrito (scrambled eggs, black beans, whole-wheat tortilla)
Lunch: Leftover turkey stir-fry
Dinner: Chicken skewers with roasted vegetables
Snack: Banana

Day 7:
Breakfast: Whole-wheat toast with avocado and egg
Lunch: Chicken and vegetable soup
Dinner: Lean pork chop with roasted potatoes and Brussels sprouts
Snack: Trail mix
